frequent need to administer surfactant to extremely preterm infants in the delivery', 0.9906324477905922], [[[180.0, 559.0], [1290.0, 559.0], [1290.0, 588.0], [180.0, 588.0]], 'room, treatment assignments must be made in an expeditious manner in order to enroll these', 0.9947397861215803], [[[177.0, 590.0], [1234.0, 591.0], [1234.0, 624.0], [177.0, 623.0]], 'infants in the study, while also maintaining balanced allocation of the infants to the two', 0.9953103337022994], [[[177.0, 626.0], [1340.0, 628.0], [1340.0, 658.0], [177.0, 656.0]], 'treatment arms. If these infants are not enrolled because of time constraints in the delivery room,', 0.9933454153513668], [[[178.0, 661.0], [1200.0, 662.0], [1200.0, 692.0], [178.0, 691.0]], 'then inferences may not be generalizable to such infants and enrollment may become', 0.990539460647397], [[[181.0, 693.0], [412.0, 696.0], [412.0, 729.0], [180.0, 726.0]], 'unacceptably slow.', 0.9997046523623996], [[[177.0, 758.0], [1302.0, 757.0], [1302.0, 790.0], [177.0, 791.0]], 'To address this issue, the BiB trial adapts the step-forward randomization idea of "Use Next"', 0.9835215172460002], [[[181.0, 795.0], [1263.0, 795.0], [1263.0, 825.0], [181.0, 825.0]], 'drug kits, which was originally presented by Zhao et al. (2010). Based on a randomization', 0.9877090708593305], [[[179.0, 828.0], [1324.0, 829.0], [1324.0, 859.0], [179.0, 858.0]], 'schedule centrally generated by the NRN Data Coordinating Center (DCC) at RTI, drug kits of', 0.9931319185665676], [[[179.0, 863.0], [1246.0, 864.0], [1246.0, 893.0], [179.0, 892.0]], 'budesonide respules or sham will be randomized, assembled, masked, and labeled by the', 0.9916210272732903], [[[179.0, 900.0], [1289.0, 897.0], [1289.0, 926.0], [179.0, 929.0]], 'Investigational Drug/Research Pharmacy, then stored in a locked location that will allow for', 0.9957831126192341], [[[178.0, 966.0], [1325.0, 967.0], [1325.0, 1000.0], [178.0, 999.0]], 'added to the queue such that there are at least three sets of kits available in each gestational age', 0.9882565116882325], [[[179.0, 1003.0], [1337.0, 1003.0], [1337.0, 1032.0], [179.0, 1032.0]], 'stratum at a given time, and the Investigational Drug/Research Pharmacy will be responsible for', 0.9900115835039239], [[[177.0, 1031.0], [1329.0, 1033.0], [1329.0, 1072.0], [177.0, 1070.0]], 'ordering, stocking, and supplying the respules of budesonide and sham to the NICU in the drug', 0.9951237843882653], [[[177.0, 1070.0], [1294.0, 1069.0], [1294.0, 1102.0], [177.0, 1103.0]], 'kits. Two drug kits will be prepared for each randomization number in case of the need for a', 0.9911197508158891], [[[178.0, 1106.0], [1317.0, 1105.0], [1317.0, 1135.0], [178.0, 1136.0]], 'second dose of study drug within the treatment window, thus a set of drug kits is comprised of', 0.9946223770050292], [[[180.0, 1141.0], [1311.0, 1141.0], [1311.0, 1171.0], [180.0, 1171.0]], 'two drug kits. Curosurf will be available as clinical supply and separate from the drug kits. As', 0.9874565880745649], [[[181.0, 1176.0], [1315.0, 1176.0], [1315.0, 1206.0], [181.0, 1206.0]], 'dosing for budesonide may require two respules, at least two respules of budesonide (or sham)', 0.98617850195977], [[[179.0, 1207.0], [1254.0, 1208.0], [1254.0, 1241.0], [179.0, 1239.0]], 'will be included in each drug kit, for a total of four respules in a set of drug kits (i.e., four', 0.9891779416615201], [[[180.0, 1243.0], [562.0, 1245.0], [562.0, 1274.0], [180.0, 1273.0]], 'respules per randomization ID).', 0.992553876292321], [[[179.0, 1307.0], [1332.0, 1307.0], [1332.0, 1340.0], [179.0, 1340.0]], 'In addition to labeling the drug kits with the required cautionary statement that the drug product', 0.9885912841680099], [[[176.0, 1340.0], [1342.0, 1339.0], [1342.0, 1375.0], [176.0, 1376.0]], 'is only for investigational purposes, the sequential randomization number will also be labeled on', 0.9984662071945741], [[[178.0, 1374.0], [1229.0, 1375.0], [1229.0, 1411.0], [178.0, 1410.0]], 'each kit, such that the designated person (e.g., respiratory therapist) will select the next', 0.9978082393822463], [[[182.0, 1412.0], [1320.0, 1412.0], [1320.0, 1442.0], [182.0, 1442.0]], 'sequential randomization number in the queue. If eligible multiple births are expected, then the', 0.9979238752275705], [[[179.0, 1445.0], [1242.0, 1443.0], [1242.0, 1476.0], [179.0, 1478.0]], 'corresponding number of kits will be taken from the queue in the randomization number', 0.9867260140531203], [[[180.0, 1481.0], [1226.0, 1479.0], [1226.0, 1509.0], [180.0, 1511.0]], 'ordering, as multiple gestation births will be randomized independently. Infants will be', 0.9978540113026445], [[[180.0, 1514.0], [1321.0, 1514.0], [1321.0, 1547.0], [180.0, 1547.0]], 'considered randomized and assigned to the randomization number when the masked drug kit is', 0.9944269471698337], [[[181.0, 1550.0], [1201.0, 1550.0], [1201.0, 1580.0], [181.0, 1580.0]], 'opened, which will occur after assessment of eligibility and directly before treatment', 0.9887661857660427], [[[180.0, 1585.0], [1313.0, 1585.0], [1313.0, 1615.0], [180.0, 1615.0]], 'administration. If the drug kit is not opened, then it may be returned to the queue in the locked', 0.9924266405941284], [[[178.0, 1617.0], [1349.0, 1619.0], [1349.0, 1649.0], [178.0, 1647.0]], 'location and the randomization number is considered unused. The unmasked respiratory therapist', 0.9946469480686999], [[[177.0, 1653.0], [1261.0, 1651.0], [1261.0, 1683.0], [177.0, 1685.0]], '(or other qualified designated person) will mix the budesonide or sham with Curosurf and', 0.9921071766452356], [[[180.0, 1689.0], [1323.0, 1689.0], [1323.0, 1718.0], [180.0, 1718.0]], 'administer it to the infant. The used respules will then be placed back into the masked drug kits', 0.9844524092280987], [[[181.0, 1723.0], [1323.0, 1723.0], [1323.0, 1752.0], [181.0, 1752.0]], 'with the infant study number. The Investigational Drug/Research Pharmacy will track usage of', 0.9941419615693714], [[[179.0, 1755.0], [1244.0, 1756.0], [1244.0, 1786.0], [179.0, 1785.0]], 'the Curosurf, budesonide, and sham by evaluating used vials and respules. Other clinical', 0.9889729456468062], [[[180.0, 1835.0], [379.0, 1838.0], [378.0, 1864.0], [179.0, 1861.0]], 'Version1.3,2024-09-10', 0.9966432083220709], [[[1294.0, 1836.0], [1354.0, 1836.0], [1354.0, 1865.0], [1294.0, 1865.0]], 'Page 9', 0.9934467275937399]]
